  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Noy demande le numéro de Clara.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເບີໂທຂອງເຈົ້າແມ່ນຫຍັງ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Bɤ̌ɤ-thóo khɔ̌ɔng jâo mɛ̄ɛn nyǎng?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສູນຊາວ ຫ້າສີ່ ສາມສອງ</span><span class=\"rom\">Sǔun sáaw, hâa sìi, sǎam sɔ̌ɔng.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເວົ້າຊ້າໆແດ່</span><span class=\"rom\">Wȁo sȁa-sȁa dɛ̀ɛ.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສູນ ສອງ ສູນ ຫ້າ ສີ່ ສາມ ສອງ</span><span class=\"rom\">Sǔun, sɔ̌ɔng, sǔun, hâa, sìi, sǎam, sɔ̌ɔng.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໄດ້ແລ້ວ ຂອບໃຈ</span><span class=\"rom\">Dâay lɛ̏ɛw. Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Noy</b> — C&#x27;est quoi ton numéro ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Zéro vingt, cinq quatre, trois deux.<br><b>Noy</b> — Plus lentement, s&#x27;il te plaît.<br><b>Clara</b> — Zéro, deux, zéro, cinq, quatre, trois, deux.<br><b>Noy</b> — C&#x27;est bon. Merci.</p></details>"
